# The root .gitignore has no rule for model weights, and the checkpoint this
# spike loads is a 435 MB file whose licence forbids commercial use. Committing
# it would put a non-commercial artifact inside a product we sell — the one
# mistake in this directory that would be genuinely expensive to undo, because
# git history is forever. Hence a local ignore rather than a note in the README.
weights/
*.pth
*.onnx

# Renders and test assets.
out/
*.mp4
